.claude/launch.json

# Live-preview validation artifacts (screenshots, matrices). Never committed.
# ANCHORED to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, `validation/` matches a
# directory at ANY depth, and it silently swallowed
# `src/intent_engine/validation/` — the canonical 100-company manifest and the
# Breaker-10 cohort selector. `git status` stayed clean, the tracked tests and
# break proofs that import it could not run from a fresh checkout of the frozen
# SHA, and for a while the only copy of that module in existence was an
# untracked file in one ephemeral scratchpad worktree.
/validation/
